@inherits LayoutComponentBase

@*
    Chrome-free shell.

    For pages that own the whole viewport — the presentation view, and the
    account screens that stand outside the app's navigation. Same tokens,
    same typeface, same theme as everything else; it simply omits the rail
    and the header rather than substituting a different look.

    AuthLayout is deliberately left alone: the sign-in screen is out of
    scope for this redesign and keeps its own treatment.
*@

<div class="hr-app hr-focus">
    @Body
</div>
